WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=yo.

1
00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:09.680
Fidio yii ṣe afihan bi o ṣe le ṣe idanwo iwaju oju nipa lilo awọn

2
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.900
lupu apa iwaju ti ẹrọ Arclight.

3
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.406
Bẹrẹ pẹlu mimọ ọwọ ati ṣafihan ararẹ.

4
00:00:17.406 --> 00:00:24.920
Jẹrisi idanimọ alaisan, ṣalaye idanwo naa, ati gba aṣẹ lati ṣe.

5
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:29.470
Ni ibẹrẹ gba iṣẹju diẹ lati ṣe akiyesi awọn oju mejeeji ni akoko kanna.

6
00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:31.920
Wo periorbitor, ipenpeju ati oju.

7
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:38.160
Ọrọ sisọ lori wiwu eyikeyi, pupa ati itujade, bakanna bi olokiki ti awọn oju tabi ajeji

8
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.680
ipo ipenpeju.

9
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.608
Lẹhinna ṣe idanwo ti o ga ni lilo ina arc.

10
00:00:43.608 --> 00:00:45.560
Yipada lori funfun ina ati

11
00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.679
mu ẹrọ naa sunmọ oju rẹ.

12
00:00:47.679 --> 00:00:50.100
Laiyara sunmọ oju ọtun alaisan ni akọkọ titi

13
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.220
o wa ni idojukọ.

14
00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.900
Eyi yoo jẹ nipa 6 cm.

15
00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:55.420
Bi alaisan lati gbe oju wọn si ita ati

16
00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:58.749
inu, lẹhinna si oke ati isalẹ, lakoko ti o rọra di awọn ipenpeju wọn.

17
00:00:58.749 --> 00:01:00.080
Ifinufindo akiyesi kan ti o yatọ

18
00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:02.675
awọn ẹya ri, lerongba ti wọn ni awọn ẹgbẹ.

19
00:01:02.675 --> 00:01:05.640
Ẹgbẹ akọkọ pẹlu oke ati isalẹ

20
00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:08.432
eyelashes ati ideri ala.

21
00:01:08.432 --> 00:01:16.110
Awọn keji pẹlu kan conjunctiva ati sclera ati isalẹ forenicks.

22
00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:20.425
Ẹgbẹ kẹta ni cornea, ipade ti eyi pẹlu sclera ti a npe ni

23
00:01:20.425 --> 00:01:21.350
awọn limbis ati

24
00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:23.579
akẹẹkọ, ti yika nipasẹ awọn iris.

25
00:01:23.579 --> 00:01:26.550
Ni kete ti o ba ti pari akiyesi gbogbo awọn ẹya wọnyi, ni bayi

26
00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:29.190
Bayi yan ina bulu lori ina arc.

27
00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:34.310
Pẹlu awọ fluorescing, fiimu yiya, awọn agbegbe ti pipadanu epithelial ati arun yoo jẹ afihan.

28
00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:37.270
Awọn awọ fluoresces didan pẹlu ina bulu.

29
00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:42.430
Ṣe igbasilẹ lori aworan apẹrẹ oju ati iwọn awọn agbegbe ti pipadanu epithelial ati arun.

30
00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.410
Pari nipa ṣiṣe ayẹwo awo tarsal ti o ga julọ.

31
00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:50.030
Gbe egbọn owu kan sori ideri oke, lẹhinna rọra gbe awọn lashes soke lakoko ti o lọra

32
00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:52.550
titẹ si isalẹ pẹlu egbọn.

33
00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:57.562
ti a ṣe akiyesi pẹlu oju ihoho, lẹhinna mu ina arc wa fun wiwo ti o ga.

34
00:01:57.562 --> 00:01:58.230
Tun eyi tun

35
00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:00.130
ayewo lori awọn miiran oju.

36
00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:03.550
Lẹhinna, dupẹ lọwọ alaisan, ṣe akopọ ati ṣe igbasilẹ awọn awari rẹ

37
00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:04.614
ki o si tun ọwọ tenilorun.

38
00:02:04.614 --> 00:02:08.070
Jọwọ wo ile-ẹkọ giga wa miiran ti St Andrews Arc Light

39
00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:08.990
Awọn fidio ise agbese.
